"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"name_components":[{"id":"nc-jin040-jiachong-093","person_id":"0ib_u9i_8um","surname":"楊","ming":null,"additional_names":[],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-040-jiachong-family","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-040-jiachong-family:p010","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-040-jiachong-family:p010:m0142","quote":"充既外出，自以爲失職，深銜任愷，計無所從。將之鎮，百僚餞於夕陽亭，荀勖私焉。充以憂告，勖曰：「公，國之宰輔，而爲一夫所制，不亦鄙乎！然是行也，辭之實難，獨有結婚太子，不頓駕而自留矣。」充曰：「然。孰可寄懷？」對曰：「勖請行之。」俄而侍宴，論太子婚姻事，勖因言充女才質令淑，宜配儲宮。而楊皇后及荀顗亦並稱之。帝納其言。會京師大雪，平地二尺，軍不得發。既而皇儲當婚，遂不西行。詔充居本職。先是羊祜密啟留充，及是，帝以語充。充謝祜曰：「始知君長者。」","status":"editorial_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"note":"本源以楊皇后氏稱，不補諱或由氏稱連父系。","fixed_biography_name_binding":{"kind":"fixed_punctuated_biography_name","source_revision":2606035,"paragraph_sha256":"25dbd8f7a3900cd2d4e4ed8b33f109f16d91ca96ef8df75f65089a173381b03c","mode":"surname_title","name_mention_id":"c-jinshu-040-jiachong-family:p010:m0142","zi_mention_id":null,"alias_bindings":[],"title_prefix":null,"title_suffix":"皇后"},"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-040","source_id":"s-jinshu-040-ws2606035-jiachong-family"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-040-jiachong-family:p010:m0142","kind":"person","person_id":"0ib_u9i_8um","surface":"楊皇后","start":142,"end":145,"status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"依本傳完整敘事與本段角色辨識；逐人理由另存身份閱讀記錄。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-040-jiachong-family:p010","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-040-jiachong-family"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-jin040-jiachong-family-holding_256","person_id":"0ib_u9i_8um","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-040","source_id":"s-jinshu-040-ws2606035-jiachong-family","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-040-jiachong-family","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-040-jiachong-fami